<title>CHINA: Dazhong Taxi interim net up 52.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Dazhong Taxi interim net up 52.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)  Turnover		   343.321	 vs   280.806</p>
<p> Net profit		 85.460	 vs    55.954</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.50  yuan  vs     4.23</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.20  yuan  vs     0.34</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Dazhong Taxi Co Ltd</p>
<p>The company made a one-for-one stock bonus issue this year based on  1996 net and capital reserves. Company had 425.852 million shares  vs 212.93 million prior to the bonus.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement. The figures  are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
</text>
